  "about": "I am an adept software engineer with over 20+ years of experience designing, implementing and supporting software products. I am enthusiastic about working in assignments that are challenging and interesting with opportunities to apply and continue to improve and learn new skills.  I love working in team environments and collaborating with colleagues because the end result is something amazing. I continually challenge myself by selecting assignments where I can strengthen my skills and learn new skills.\n\nAn example of one of my recent accomplishments was leading the design and implementation for the installation, setup and lifecycle management for containerized products writing Ansible operators utilizing Operator-SDK framework and deploying to hybrid and public cloud environments. I used build and devOps tools like Github, Travis CI, Jenkins and Tekton pipelines. \n\nI pride myself on being flexible and will take on assignments that are critical to the development of a product but may not be as desirable by some developers. For example, I drove the effort to achieve certification for some products. Certification ensures the product follows all the best Kubernetes practices, adheres to security requirements, following requirements for  life cycle management, and consistency of all other products across the company. \n\nI have acquired a great set of skills and experiences that I am excited to share in my next adventure.  \n• Kubernetes/Docker design programming\n• Experience using Build/Devops tooling (Git/Github, Travis CI, Jenkins, Apache Ant, Tekton pipelines)\n• Build Ansible operator using Operator-SDK framework\n• Wide range of programming experience (Java, Python, Ansible, BASH, Perl, YAML, Helm (2/3), Jinja2)\n• Various platforms (RedHat OpenShift, IBM Cloud, RedHat Enterprise Linux, SUSE Linux Enterprise Server, \nCommunity Enterprise Operator System)\n\nI look forward to including you in my next adventure.",
